{"name":"Candy Floss Cupcake","hex":"#fff0de","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"candy","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Crystallized sugar formed by boiling down sugar syrup.","Edible, sweet-tasting confectionery containing sugar, or sometimes artificial sweeteners, and often flavored with fruit, chocolate, nuts, herbs and spices, or artificial flavors."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To cook in or coat with sugar syrup.","To form into congelations or crystals, especially of sugar or syrup."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/candy"},{"term":"floss","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A thread used to clean the gaps between the teeth.","Raw silk fibres."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To clean the area between (the teeth) using floss.","To show off, especially by exhibiting one's wealth or talent."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/floss"},{"term":"cupcake","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A small cake baked in a usually paper container shaped like a cup, often with icing on top.","An attractive young woman."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To flirt; to talk or act amorously or intimately.","To flirt with; to talk or act amorously or intimately to."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cupcake"}],"entries":[{"title":"Cotton candy","blocks":[{"text":"Cotton candy, also known as candy floss (candyfloss) and fairy floss, is a spun sugar confection that resembles cotton. It is made by heating and liquefying sugar, and spinning it centrifugally through minute holes, causing it to rapidly cool and re-solidify into fine strands. It usually contains small amounts of food flavoring and it naturally bears the color of the sugar it is made of, often altered with food coloring."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e1/Cotton_candy_%CE%9C%CE%B1%CE%BB%CE%BB%CE%AF_%CF%84%CE%B7%CF%82_%CE%B3%CF%81%CE%B9%CE%AC%CF%82.JPG/330px-Cotton_candy_%CE%9C%CE%B1%CE%BB%CE%BB%CE%AF_%CF%84%CE%B7%CF%82_%CE%B3%CF%81%CE%B9%CE%AC%CF%82.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cotton_candy"},{"title":"Candy","blocks":[{"text":"Candy, also known as sweets and lollies, is a confection that features sugar as a principal ingredient. The category, sugar confectionery, encompasses any sweet confection, including chocolate or chewing gum. Sugar-glazed vegetables, fruit, or nuts are considered candied."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Candy_in_Damascus.jpg/330px-Candy_in_Damascus.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Candy"},{"title":"Cupcake","blocks":[{"text":"A cupcake, fairy cake (BrE), patty cake (AuE), or bun (IrE) is a small cake designed to serve one person, which may be baked in a small thin paper or aluminum cup. As with larger cakes, frosting, icing and various other cake decorations such as fruit and candy may be applied."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Cupcakes%2C_chocolate_and_strawberry_flavour.jpg/330px-Cupcakes%2C_chocolate_and_strawberry_flavour.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cupcake"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Cotton_Candy_Machine.jpg/500px-Cotton_Candy_Machine.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Cotton_Candy_Machine.jpg/1280px-Cotton_Candy_Machine.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Cotton_Candy_Machine.jpg/500px-Cotton_Candy_Machine.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Cotton candy machine","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File